      "title": "Orchestrating Multi-Element Animations",
      "sourceHash": "777c210f22f16048e90615321e9f5f87f37d853e27a2a2a2ccdde5d0fad7a5de",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.42,
          "end": 1.83,
          "en": "Now in this list here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.83,
          "end": 2.94,
          "en": "which we're animating,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 2.94,
          "end": 5.85,
          "en": "there also are other things we could animate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 5.85,
          "end": 8.91,
          "en": "besides the remaining item moving around.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 8.91,
          "end": 10.8,
          "en": "For example, we could also animate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 10.8,
          "end": 12.78,
          "en": "the disappearance of the item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 12.78,
          "end": 14.73,
          "en": "So not just the item that remains,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 14.73,
          "end": 16.41,
          "en": "that moves to a new position,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 16.41,
          "end": 18.51,
          "en": "but also the item that disappears.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 18.51,
          "end": 20.52,
          "en": "And we already learned before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 20.52,
          "end": 22.17,
          "en": "at the example of the modal here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 22.17,
          "end": 25.323,
          "en": "how we can animate the disappearance of an element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 26.28,
          "end": 29.28,
          "en": "We need that AnimatePresence component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 29.28,
          "end": 31.41,
          "en": "And here in this case, for this list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 31.41,
          "end": 34.02,
          "en": "we need it in the Challenges.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 34.02,
          "end": 37.86,
          "en": "because that is where I'm rendering this list of items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 37.86,
          "end": 40.65,
          "en": "So that's in the end also the code that's controlling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 40.65,
          "end": 42.36,
          "en": "how many items are displayed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 42.36,
          "end": 44.94,
          "en": "and it's also this code that updates the list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 44.94,
          "end": 47.343,
          "en": "if this array of items here changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 48.39,
          "end": 51.45,
          "en": "Therefore it's in this Challenges.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 51.45,
          "end": 54.19,
          "en": "where we should import AnimatePresence",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 55.5,
          "end": 57.393,
          "en": "from Framer Motion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 58.47,
          "end": 63.15,
          "en": "Now with AnimatePresence imported here in Challenges.jsx",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 63.15,
          "end": 66.15,
          "en": "we can now wrap it here around this code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 66.15,
          "end": 67.26,
          "en": "that is responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 67.26,
          "end": 69.483,
          "en": "for rendering this list of challenge items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 70.65,
          "end": 74.38,
          "en": "So here we wrap AnimatePresence around challenge item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 76.56,
          "end": 79.53,
          "en": "and inside of the challenge item component file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 79.53,
          "end": 84.27,
          "en": "here on this list item, which already is a motion component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.27,
          "end": 86.94,
          "en": "we can add our exit prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 86.94,
          "end": 91.023,
          "en": "to define the animation we wanna play as an item is removed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.58,
          "end": 93.87,
          "en": "And here we could, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.87,
          "end": 98.58,
          "en": "set exit to an animation where the Y position,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.58,
          "end": 102.18,
          "en": "so the position along the vertical axis should change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.18,
          "end": 104.58,
          "en": "by minus 30 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.58,
          "end": 107.7,
          "en": "So moving the item up by 30 pixels",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 107.7,
          "end": 110.343,
          "en": "and the opacity should change to zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 111.72,
          "end": 114.75,
          "en": "Now whenever we remove an item from the list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 114.75,
          "end": 116.78999999999999,
          "en": "this is the animation that should be played.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 116.78999999999999,
          "end": 119.85300000000001,
          "en": "The item should become transparent and be moved up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 122.04,
          "end": 123.45,
          "en": "Now if I save that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 123.45,
          "end": 126.81,
          "en": "and I go here to my list with two items and important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126.81,
          "end": 129.123,
          "en": "it must contain at least two items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 130.11,
          "end": 132.18,
          "en": "If I click mark as completed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.18,
          "end": 134.1,
          "en": "which will remove this first item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.1,
          "end": 137.4,
          "en": "you see it moves up and then only once it's gone,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 137.4,
          "end": 139.593,
          "en": "does the other item move into its place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 140.49,
          "end": 143.43,
          "en": "So that works, but it does not work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 143.43,
          "end": 147.76,
          "en": "if I remove the last item, that still disappears instantly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 148.74,
          "end": 152.43,
          "en": "and this item still disappears instantly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 152.43,
          "end": 155.52,
          "en": "because if we go back to Challenges.jsx",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 155.52,
          "end": 157.65,
          "en": "and we take a look at this code here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 157.65,
          "end": 160.47,
          "en": "we can see that actually this entire ordered list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 160.47,
          "end": 164.76,
          "en": "is removed from the DOM, if displayedChallenges,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 164.76,
          "end": 166.35,
          "en": "so this array of challenges",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 166.35,
          "end": 169.383,
          "en": "that should be displayed on the screen is an empty array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 170.46,
          "end": 173.1,
          "en": "So AnimatePresence has no effect then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 173.1,
          "end": 174.63,
          "en": "because this is all removed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 174.63,
          "end": 178.44299999999998,
          "en": "because it's part of this conditional rendering block here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 179.49,
          "end": 181.14,
          "en": "So what we would have to do here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 181.14,
          "end": 185.7,
          "en": "to make sure that the last item also kind of is animated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 185.7,
          "end": 188.31,
          "en": "is we would have to wrap this entire list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 188.31,
          "end": 190.39,
          "en": "with AnimatePresence as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 192.03,
          "end": 196.983,
          "en": "and then convert this ordered list to a motion ordered list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 197.85,
          "end": 199.863,
          "en": "Of course, also the closing tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 201.24,
          "end": 203.43,
          "en": "Now at the moment, I'm not importing motion here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 203.43,
          "end": 207.363,
          "en": "so I have to do that, import motion from Framer Motion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 208.92000000000002,
          "end": 213.54,
          "en": "And then with that imported here on this motion order list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 213.54,
          "end": 216.423,
          "en": "which is now wrapped by AnimatePresence,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 217.38,
          "end": 220.5,
          "en": "we can also set an exit animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 220.5,
          "end": 223.38,
          "en": "And here, for example, play the same animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 223.38,
          "end": 225.45,
          "en": "as I did for the individual item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 225.45,
          "end": 228.66,
          "en": "so that the overall list is also animated out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 228.66,
          "end": 230.163,
          "en": "if it disappears.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 232.92000000000002,
          "end": 236.55,
          "en": "And now if you do that, if I remove the first item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 236.55,
          "end": 238.44,
          "en": "in my case here in the completed list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 238.44,
          "end": 241.98,
          "en": "by marking it as failed, that's still animated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 241.98,
          "end": 245.34,
          "en": "But the last item now also is kind of animated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 245.34,
          "end": 247.05,
          "en": "because it was that list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 247.05,
          "end": 249.453,
          "en": "that was now removed with an animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 250.83,
          "end": 253.26,
          "en": "We therefore now also get animation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 253.26,
          "end": 255.45,
          "en": "if we switch between those tabs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 255.45,
          "end": 258.03,
          "en": "at least if we go from a list with items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 258.03,
          "end": 259.533,
          "en": "to a list without items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 260.37,
          "end": 263.19,
          "en": "because of course if we switch tabs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 263.19,
          "end": 265.68,
          "en": "what happens technically in this code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 265.68,
          "end": 267.66,
          "en": "is that state changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 267.66,
          "end": 271.08299999999997,
          "en": "and displayedChallenges becomes an empty array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 272.31,
          "end": 275.07,
          "en": "Because I'm deriving it up here by filtering it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 275.07,
          "end": 276.12,
          "en": "and by changing lists,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 276.12,
          "end": 279.063,
          "en": "I'm simply ending up with a list that then is empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 280.02,
          "end": 282.69,
          "en": "Therefore, since after switching tabs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 282.69,
          "end": 286.32,
          "en": "displayedChallenges sometimes may be empty,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 286.32,
          "end": 287.97,
          "en": "this entire list is removed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 287.97,
          "end": 290.163,
          "en": "and the exit animation is played.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 291.18,
          "end": 293.43,
          "en": "That's why we're seeing this animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 293.43,
          "end": 296.19,
          "en": "if we're switching from a tab with items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 296.19,
          "end": 298.173,
          "en": "to a tab without items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 299.73,
          "end": 302.58,
          "en": "What you also might have noticed is that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 302.58,
          "end": 305.1,
          "en": "as the last item is removed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 305.1,
          "end": 307.323,
          "en": "if you take a look here at the bottom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 309.69,
          "end": 311.73,
          "en": "there's no challenges found text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 311.73,
          "end": 315.66,
          "en": "actually occurred before the list was gone.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 315.66,
          "end": 318.69,
          "en": "And that's of course not necessarily the behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 318.69,
          "end": 320.82,
          "en": "we might want to have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 320.82,
          "end": 324.99,
          "en": "And we can fix this behavior by wrapping AnimatePresence",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 324.99,
          "end": 327.78,
          "en": "not just around that list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 327.78,
          "end": 332.46,
          "en": "but actually also around this fallback paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 332.46,
          "end": 335.4,
          "en": "that's shown if we have no items in the list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 335.4,
          "end": 336.843,
          "en": "for this selected tab.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 339.03,
          "end": 341.22,
          "en": "Though, that alone is not enough",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 341.22,
          "end": 345.12,
          "en": "because as you'll see, if I empty this list again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 345.12,
          "end": 348.093,
          "en": "it still does not behave the way I want it to behave.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 349.17,
          "end": 352.56,
          "en": "Instead now it suddenly disappears instantly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 352.56,
          "end": 354.27,
          "en": "which is not what I want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 354.27,
          "end": 357.063,
          "en": "Where is that exit animation we had before?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 357.96,
          "end": 360.36,
          "en": "Well, to bring back this exit animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 360.36,
          "end": 362.46,
          "en": "of this ordered list here again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 362.46,
          "end": 366.243,
          "en": "we now have to tweak this ordered list and this paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 367.2,
          "end": 369.99,
          "en": "Because now here in this AnimatePresence",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 369.99,
          "end": 373.26,
          "en": "that wraps both the list and the paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 373.26,
          "end": 376.89300000000003,
          "en": "we of course have two elements, the list and the paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 377.85,
          "end": 381.3,
          "en": "And even though those elements are of different types,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 381.3,
          "end": 383.49,
          "en": "an ordered list and a paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 383.49,
          "end": 386.31,
          "en": "we need to add the key prop now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 386.31,
          "end": 389.313,
          "en": "to help Framer Motion tell them apart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 390.75,
          "end": 394.14,
          "en": "Now, we also needed that here on this AnimatePresence here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 394.14,
          "end": 398.31,
          "en": "with the challenge items but those items already had a key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 398.31,
          "end": 401.31,
          "en": "And we did not need that before in the header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 401.31,
          "end": 404.74,
          "en": "where we conditionally rendered the new challenge component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 405.6,
          "end": 407.85,
          "en": "because here we only had one component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 407.85,
          "end": 409.383,
          "en": "between AnimatePresence.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 410.22,
          "end": 412.32,
          "en": "But whenever you have more than one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 412.32,
          "end": 415.62,
          "en": "you should add a key to every element here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 415.62,
          "end": 419.523,
          "en": "in AnimatePresence to help Framer Motion tell them apart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 420.63,
          "end": 423.09,
          "en": "And here, this can be a hardcoded key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 423.09,
          "end": 425.79,
          "en": "This ordered list can get a key off list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 425.79,
          "end": 428.46,
          "en": "and this fallback paragraph here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 428.46,
          "end": 431.283,
          "en": "can get a key of fallback, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 433.596,
          "end": 436.74,
          "en": "But if you do that, if you add those keys, you'll see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 436.74,
          "end": 439.77,
          "en": "that now as we empty those lists,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 439.77,
          "end": 442.77,
          "en": "the animation is back, but we still see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 442.77,
          "end": 445.68,
          "en": "that fallback text at the same point of time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 445.68,
          "end": 448.413,
          "en": "where the last item is animated out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 449.85,
          "end": 451.62,
          "en": "And to get rid of this behavior,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 451.62,
          "end": 454.53,
          "en": "we now have to do one last thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 454.53,
          "end": 457.35,
          "en": "We have to configure this AnimatePresence",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 457.35,
          "end": 460.473,
          "en": "that does wrap our ordered list and this paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 461.67,
          "end": 465.723,
          "en": "There we have to set the mode prop and set it to wait.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 466.83,
          "end": 468.51,
          "en": "The default is sync,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 468.51,
          "end": 471.21,
          "en": "which means it plays all the animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 471.21,
          "end": 475.08,
          "en": "inside of this component here simultaneously.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 475.08,
          "end": 478.47,
          "en": "So if one element disappears like this list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 478.47,
          "end": 481.56,
          "en": "and one element appears like this paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 481.56,
          "end": 484.953,
          "en": "it plays both animations at the same point of time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 486.99,
          "end": 489.66,
          "en": "Now here we actually want it to wait,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 489.66,
          "end": 492.06,
          "en": "and hence we have to set the mode to wait",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 492.06,
          "end": 495.9,
          "en": "for this first element to disappear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 495.9,
          "end": 498.813,
          "en": "before it plays any appearance animations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 500.4,
          "end": 503.01,
          "en": "So therefore, now if we set mode wait here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 503.01,
          "end": 507.06,
          "en": "it will wait for this item to be animated out,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 507.06,
          "end": 508.44,
          "en": "this last item here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 508.44,
          "end": 512.403,
          "en": "before it then displace the animation of this fallback text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 513.72,
          "end": 517.83,
          "en": "And at the moment, this text actually has no animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 517.83,
          "end": 520.38,
          "en": "though we could of course add one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 520.38,
          "end": 522.78,
          "en": "We could change this from a standard paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 522.78,
          "end": 524.56,
          "en": "to a motion paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 526.56,
          "end": 528.78,
          "en": "and then add an entry animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 528.78,
          "end": 531.303,
          "en": "by adding the initial and animate props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 532.29,
          "end": 534.93,
          "en": "And initial could be set to an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 534.93,
          "end": 536.94,
          "en": "where the the opacity is zero",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 536.94,
          "end": 540.333,
          "en": "and the item is pushed up by 20 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 541.47,
          "end": 544.2,
          "en": "And animate could be set to an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 544.2,
          "end": 546.543,
          "en": "where opacity is then set to one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 547.47,
          "end": 549.78,
          "en": "So that's the target state we want to have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 549.78,
          "end": 553.563,
          "en": "as the entry animation is played and y is zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 555.9,
          "end": 559.08,
          "en": "And of course, we could also add an exit animation here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 559.08,
          "end": 561.81,
          "en": "and for example, set the opacity back to zero",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 561.81,
          "end": 564.723,
          "en": "and y to minus 20 again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 565.59,
          "end": 568.32,
          "en": "And we could also use variance if we wanted to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 568.32,
          "end": 569.19,
          "en": "but here I'll use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 569.19,
          "end": 571.833,
          "en": "these standard configuration objects instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 574.26,
          "end": 578.13,
          "en": "And with that, you'll see that now, if I switch tabs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 578.13,
          "end": 582.813,
          "en": "this text also is animated out as I switch tabs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 583.68,
          "end": 585.63,
          "en": "And then if I empty my list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 585.63,
          "end": 588.78,
          "en": "now this last item is first animated out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 588.78,
          "end": 591.333,
          "en": "before it then animates this text in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 592.83,
          "end": 595.47,
          "en": "And that's how you can use AnimatePresence",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 595.47,
          "end": 597.96,
          "en": "also with multiple items to control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 597.96,
          "end": 600.27,
          "en": "how these different items are animated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 600.27,
          "end": 603.453,
          "en": "and how they are animated in relation to each other.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}